Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.57,0:00:03.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.93,0:00:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,1967年4月21日\N{\fnArial\fs30}On April 21, 1967,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一亿辆通用汽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}the 100 millionth GM vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在简斯维尔的工厂生产下线\N{\fnArial\fs30}rolled off the line at the plant in Janesville …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.19,0:00:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天之后 另一辆车在同一生产线上下线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days later, another car rolled off that same line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆1967年款的雪佛兰英帕拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This 1967 Chevrolet Impala.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会成为世上最重要的车…\N{\fnArial\fs30}would turn out to be the most important object …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为整个宇宙的重中之重\N{\fnArial\fs30}in pretty much the whole universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听她的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to her purr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是你想要的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the car you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你对车很有研究吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? You know something about cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于车的知识 都是我父亲教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad taught me everything about cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我很久没祈祷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's been a long time…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩和我 我们经历了很多坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean and I, we've… we've been through a lot of bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次是我的错 我不知道该怎么补救\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my fault, and I don't know how to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.53,0:00:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要帮助 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need your help, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要知道希望尚存\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to know there's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:48.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:07.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨·温 迪·温）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第11季第4集]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:47.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（48小时前）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.66,0:01:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 短裤是闹哪样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what's up with the shorts?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.18,0:01:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地堡下面是自由世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a free bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.45,0:01:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于黑暗 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on the Darkness. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.71,0:02:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不见踪影 没有线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still in the wind. No leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有个古老的邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have an ancient evil out there somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.97,0:02:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都愈发强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just getting stronger by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.58,0:02:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡在好转了 这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is getting better, so there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.02,0:02:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想帮你治好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still wants to fix your, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.94,0:02:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 百分百没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. Fine. 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他还没百分百呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要时间疗伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}He still needs more time to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们只能慢慢等着疗伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we got nothing to do but get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你怎么样 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about you, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是憋出严重的幽居病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got some serious cabin fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.05,0:02:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的车我都洗过两次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've washed every car in here twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能找到桩案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I may have found us a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.28,0:02:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 虽然不太靠谱 - 那也成啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, it's thin… - Hey, thin works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,路上说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道一洗车就下雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.47,0:02:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 说吧 什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's hear it. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄勒冈州 尤金市外的贵格会谷镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, Quaker Valley, Oregon, town outside of Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,德怀恩·马克汉姆 当地治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}DWayne Markham, the local sheriff,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.78,0:02:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,几日前在林中被人发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}was found in the woods a couple days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.35,0:02:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体被残害\N{\fnArial\fs30}His body was mauled,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是被认为是动物袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they chalked it up to an animal attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我想可能是… - 狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but I'm thinking… - Werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:02:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 可能吧 - 是啊 的确不太靠谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, maybe. - Yeah, you're right. That is thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可能不是案子 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Probably nothing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧 俄勒冈州 我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not. Oregon, here we come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是冰沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a smoothie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰沙下面呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under the smoothies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的啤酒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the rest of the beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, it's Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.39,0:03:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得接 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta… we gotta… I gotta get this. - Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.93,0:03:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass. Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚在看你们要去的那一带的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just reading up about the other cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the area that you're headed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.69,0:03:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没发现符合这些特征的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't found anything yet that matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你只有一项任务 就是疗伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you've got one job to do and that's to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白了吗 - 我能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You understand? - I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course you can, Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 你该专注于好起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now is the time for you to focus on getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:03:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是小菜一碟 我们能行的 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a milk run. We got it. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尽量放松一下吧 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Try and relax. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,读本书 看看网飞什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read a book, watch some netflix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a netflix?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,去我屋 打开电视 你会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to my room, turn on the tv. You'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 有事打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Just call if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 小卡 谢啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it, Cass. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他会没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just needs some time, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.75,0:04:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 都多晚了 我累死了 也饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's late. I'm exhausted and… and… and starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this place…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连史威兹都不会到这种旅馆来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, even Swayze wouldn't come to this roadhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 永远别乱用史威兹的大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, first of all, never use Swayze's name in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 永远不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 你不记得这里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second, you don't remember this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不记得海瑟了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember Heather?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前跟我们一起合作温迪戈案子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hunter that we worked a wendigo case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:05:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个猎人 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- a couple years ago? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 她今晚在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, exactly. - What, she's here tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给她发了短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I texted her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在德州办个法国狼人的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's working a rugaru case in Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.74,0:05:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 她没回我短信 但那不是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, she never texted me back. That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是 我们还要开很久呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, is that we have a ton of driving left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了去个可能根本没案子的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to go to a town where there's probably not a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那里面 有快乐时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in there…Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.18,0:05:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间能治愈一切伤口 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And time heals all wounds, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是快乐的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.49,0:05:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 你自便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say, knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找个餐馆 像小卡那样查查传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find a diner, dig into the lore like Cass did,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们要去的地方有没有什么事发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if anything's ever happened where we're headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 你真得学会找乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, you really gotta learn to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 太可悲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, it's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistakes were made.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我哥哥迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh, my brother Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 萨姆 我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Sam, I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你有客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize you had company.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.92,0:06:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 能给我们点时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, uh, could you give us a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…先出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll just, uh… Just won't be here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们慢慢来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you kids take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到我的发夹了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen my hairpin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我可以解释怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I can explain what was going on…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:01.23,Title,0,0,0,0,,别放《夜行客》嘲笑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't "Night Moves" me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让歌声洗刷你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it wash over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉浸其中吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,史上最伟大的摇滚乐手之一啊 萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the greatest rock writers of all time, Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.73,0:07:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,*在我哥哥67款雪佛兰的后座上*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Out in the backseat of my brother's '67 Chevy*
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你挑的头 你挑的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you started this. You started this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,*趁着夜色练习动作*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Workin' on our night moves*
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.11,0:08:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我来选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别碰方向盘 - 你都没看路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hands off the wheel. - You're not even looking at the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,查查传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Digging into tho lore."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今的孩子都这么个说法啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what the kids are calling it these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真需要那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I needed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.55,0:08:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hey, look at that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.13,0:08:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于破处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're finally not a virgin anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但知道吗 我觉得也是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what? I think it was time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尊重你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I respect the fact that you, uh, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要保持纯真 等待真爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wanted to stay true and pure and waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.53,0:08:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 你就是个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know what? You… you're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还铺了毯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even put a blanket down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 总是那么有风度又体贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, classy and thoughtful as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想把我的号码给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to give her my number.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道她说什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what she said?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今夜逍遥快活 明天分道扬镳\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We got tonight. Who needs tomorrow"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么事都往鲍勃·西格的歌上靠吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything a Bob Seger song to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你 佩珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was nice knowing you, Piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:08:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piper?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太赞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,海瑟 一夜奇迹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather. One-night wonders, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.59,0:09:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我们还能有这等艳福就算走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot, we're lucky we still get that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? You don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要更多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever want something more?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你认识我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, have you met us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本没有过上家庭生活的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're batting a whopping zero in domestic life, man. Goose eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.74,0:09:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不会想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't ever think about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是婚姻什么的 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not marriage or whatever. But…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如跟猎人发展段感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something? You know, with a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,理解我们这种生活的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody who understands the life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听到鲍勃歌里的歌词吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you not heard a single word Bob's been singing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你累了 我看得出 你是累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're tired. I can tell. You're exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还精神饱满呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm still wired,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我停车去加点油\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm gonna pull over, get some gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上后面去睡会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hop in the back, get some z's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该睡会儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, buddy, you earned 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你骄傲啊 佩珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proud of ya! Piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她好香啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, she smelled good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.45,0:10:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you listening to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.71,0:10:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈以前可喜欢这首歌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom used to love this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你像是见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look a little spooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,能重回驾驶席感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}It's nice to be back behind the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来迪恩很会照顾这老家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Dean's taken good care of this old beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他把你照顾得也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like he's taken good care of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么回事 又是幻觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? Another vision?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:10:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近经常看到幻觉吗 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you having visions, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么喊我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.99,0:11:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 当爹的还不能喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? A father can't call his…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我父亲已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my father is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡什么时候阻挡过温家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When has death ever stopped a Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不知道这怎么回事 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know what this is, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前说的 关于感情的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you said about relationships,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要更深层次的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}wanting something more…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本没想让你们过上这种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted this for you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This life. Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过得也还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We turned out okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.45,0:11:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是你们的努力 你们做到的 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was on you boys. You did that, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也尽了职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you played your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我至少是尽了全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did my best, anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.68,0:11:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what it was worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向都骗不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never could fool you, could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在教堂里时祈祷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prayed when I was in that church,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.44,0:12:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saw…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.82,0:12:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你出现了 不管你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, here you are, whoever you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.87,0:12:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦 幻觉 随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream. Vision. Call it what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,传递的讯息是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The message is still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.09,0:12:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness is coming…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你们能阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And only you boys can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.71,0:12:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need help,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是看到死人的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}not visions of dead people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝帮助自助者\N{\fnArial\fs30}God helps those who help themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到温家旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Winchester motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.01,0:13:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有有线电视 但我们有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have cable, but we do…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,客房服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}have room service.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡觉时还唱歌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were singing in your sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是妈妈喜欢 爸爸老放给我们听的那首\N{\fnArial\fs30}That song mom loved that dad used to always play for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像还有那盘带呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've actually still got the tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.73,0:13:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.11,0:13:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你看到黑暗时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said when you saw the Darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.55,0:13:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不确定那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you weren't sure whether it was, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的还是幻觉 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the real thing or a vision, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.37,0:13:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我最近也看到了些幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've been having visions, too, lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.61,0:13:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是一些画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's just images.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是感觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, more of a… feeling, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:13:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我刚刚又看到一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:14:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就刚刚 而且还看到了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}right now, and… and dad was in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't dad like… like…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候看到的那个爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dad that… that I grew up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是像我们这么大的那个爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was dad when he was our age.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜那根本都不是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I-I guess it wasn't even really dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.39,0:14:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是谁装成了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was someone pretending to be dad and…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 他跟我说了一切我想听的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}For starters, he told me everything I wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.69,0:14:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 听上去不像是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that doesn't sound like dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.99,0:14:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 总之 那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Anyways, whoever it was…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们传递了一则讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}they had a message to deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.79,0:14:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人说黑暗要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said the Darkness is coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}and…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你我能阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}only you and I can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人给你什么关于怎么阻止它的有用建议了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they have him give you any helpful tips on how to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 「上帝帮助自助者」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, "God helps those who help themselves."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这幻觉是上帝给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe these visions are coming from God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.97,0:14:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,打住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pump the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.65,0:14:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 第一个幻觉是我祈祷后看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Dean, the first one happened after I prayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你祈祷了 什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You prayed? When was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在医院的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.75,0:14:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.45,0:15:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时被感染了 现在没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was infected. I'm not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没完全发狂过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I never went full rabid. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被感染了 居然不告诉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get infected and you didn't even tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.16,0:15:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 你祈祷什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean… - What did you pray about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我就是在寻求答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I was just looking for answers, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 不管是什么在你脑子里折腾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure whatever is kicking around in your head right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是感染的后遗症\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a side effect from the infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你没告诉我的那次感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you failed to tell me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't think it's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.67,0:15:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 那句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. That quote?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝帮助自助者\N{\fnArial\fs30}"God helps those who help themselves"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:42.72,Title,0,0,0,0,,那不是上帝的话 都不在《圣经》里\N{\fnArial\fs30}God didn't say that. That's not even in the bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伊索时期的老谚语\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an old proverb that dates way back to Aesop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也读书啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要的是 上帝什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And more importantly, when was the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,回应过我们的祈祷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God answered any one of our prayers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是幻觉 萨姆 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a vision, Sam. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个热夜之梦而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just some… Some fever dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.70,0:16:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于爸爸 我经常梦到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as far as dad goes, I dream about dad all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.25,0:16:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 而且都是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I do. It's usually the same one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.03,0:16:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都坐在车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坐在驾驶席\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sitting in the driver's seat,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.05,0:16:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸坐在副驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's sitting shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有猎枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there aren't any shotguns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.77,0:16:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有怪物 没有猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no monsters. There's no hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没有 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's none of that. It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在教我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's teaching me how to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是他当年教我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, and I'm not little like I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车时那样的小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he actually taught me how to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我16了 他在帮我拿学习驾照\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm 16, and he's helping me get my learner's permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你坐在后座\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, you're in the backseat,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,求着想开一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just begging to take a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们停在房前 我们家前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pull up to the house… the family house…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我停在了车道上 他看着我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I park in the driveway, and he looks over and he says,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落完美 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Perfect landing, son."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,每隔几个月我就会梦一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have that dream every couple of months.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺让人宽慰的 其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of comforting, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是梦到妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always dream about mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般也都是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually the same kind of thing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正常生活吗 - 嗯 正常生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Normal life? - Yeah. Normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 迪恩 刚刚那不是梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean, this wasn't just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.03,0:17:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么有人会扮成爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would somebody dress up like dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.03,0:17:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为给你传递个讯息啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give you a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.13,0:17:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不是总听他的话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't exactly have a history of listening to what he had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说黑暗也给了你一条讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you said the Darkness is… is sending messages to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许与黑暗相反的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe whatever is the opposite of the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我传递了讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}is sending messages to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这东西是上帝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think that this thing is god?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝有过多少机会撬开你的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many… how many opportunities has God had to crack this pi?ata,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且地上也没有糖果\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't see any candy on the floor, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 或许不是上帝 但我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then maybe it's not God. But I…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你想做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're trying to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找到更深远的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to find some… some greater meaning to it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 想把发生的事归咎于命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? Some… Fate to what went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.51,0:17:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我告诉你 萨姆 黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you, Sam. The Darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.41,0:17:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能帮我们了 更别提上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one's gonna help us, certainly not god,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能自己想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll have to figure this thing out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.19,0:18:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}like we always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until then…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.15,0:18:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}we hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先就是这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This case for starters,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.69,0:18:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这桩案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}which this case is…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能不是案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just probably nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, probably nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.82,0:18:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 小婊砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.47,0:18:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸检官带我去看了治安官的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coroner showed me the sheriff's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是残害得不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, it was mauled all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.71,0:19:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听 心脏不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get this… heart missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.22,0:19:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体完全被吸干了血\N{\fnArial\fs30}body completely drained of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 狼人/吸血鬼混血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? We're looking at a-a werewolf/vampire hybrid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.61,0:19:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说 狼血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it with me… a were-pire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.33,0:19:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 说嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.85,0:19:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你了 我打给了小卡 让他查看传说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. I called Cass, told him to look into the lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.97,0:19:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 治安官的接替者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, well, uh, the sheriff's replacement…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.51,0:19:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐纳利警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deputy Donnelly…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算很聪明 但我复印了一份他的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not the brightest bulb, but I got a copy of his report.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许他有遗漏 - 探员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe he missed something. - Agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的搭档了吧 沃什探员吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be your partner. Agent Walsh, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.78,0:19:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想感谢你们二位前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to thank you both for stoppin' by.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很感激你们的尽职\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really appreciate your due diligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说 你知道哪里有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, uh, do you know a motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.55,0:19:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以住一晚的旅馆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we can crash for the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.19,0:19:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要留下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stayin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.69,0:19:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 确保没有疏漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just wanna kick all the tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐尼街有家旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, there's a motel on Downey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.53,0:19:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,价位不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}that'll give you a good price.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想吃顿好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you're looking for a decent meal,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.27,0:19:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是梅尔姑妈餐厅 在火车站附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't beat Aunt Mel's, down by the train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.29,0:19:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车位不好找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parking is a bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:20:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那里有全州最棒的牛排\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's the best damn steak in the whole state.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说牛排我就心动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had me at "steak."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.65,0:20:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're cookin' with gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.76,0:20:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,代客泊车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.93,0:20:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 代客泊车是常事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, people valet park all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.62,0:20:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受生活嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, live a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到梅尔姑妈餐厅 这里是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Aunt Mel's. Home of the…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.69,0:20:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 杰西 别给我刮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, listen, uh, Jessie, not a scratch, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛抓到苍蝇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider caught a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.21,0:20:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重复 蜘蛛抓到苍蝇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, spider caught a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走啊 快点 - 来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! Come on! - Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.49,0:21:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah. Let's roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.98,0:21:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始派对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this party started.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.64,0:21:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会被解雇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 我得走了 - 我的包包呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta go. Let's go! - Where's my purse?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.71,0:21:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你大概落在自己车上了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You probably just left it in your car. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.76,0:21:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 要不得被解雇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go! I don't wanna get fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊 杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong work, Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.83,0:22:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.74,0:22:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.60,0:22:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟治安官的遗孀谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to, uh, talk to sheriff's widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉·马克汉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily Markham.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.27,0:22:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许她了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she knows something about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.25,0:22:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她丈夫为什么会去林子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}why her husband was out in the woods in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.36,0:22:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送你过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, I'll drop you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.21,0:22:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去趟发现尸体的林子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna go back to the woods where they found the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.82,0:22:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些犯罪现场照片不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wasn't right about those crime scene photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.07,0:23:05.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡西迪奥）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.50,0:23:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.95,0:23:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我主要有点困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm mostly confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.59,0:23:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道橙色跟黑色有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure how orange correlates with black…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么就新了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a way that's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.79,0:23:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰网飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step away from the netflix.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.44,0:23:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 没事 我们都连看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - It's okay. We've all had a binge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在传说中发现什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything in the lore?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确有种吃心吸血的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there is a creature that feeds on hearts and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼血鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A were-pire, you might say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.31,0:23:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我知道你想说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I know you wanna say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.51,0:23:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在传说中被称为低语\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the lore, it's referred to a whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.78,0:23:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,银能杀死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver will kill it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.54,0:23:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但以防万一还是砍头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you may want to decapitate it just to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.32,0:23:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 听上去不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.35,0:23:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在犯罪现场呢 是布置好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at the crime scene now. It was staged.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.54,0:23:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体被拖到这儿的 没有挣扎痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The body was dragged. There were no signs of struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是移尸过去伪造成动物袭击的样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Body was moved there to look more like an animal attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.24,0:23:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧 但做得不高明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe. It was pretty sloppy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.91,0:23:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还查到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh…What else you got on these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 低语有很有趣的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this. Whispers have a fascinating history.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.60,0:23:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on. - They're… they're…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.66,0:23:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们曾被认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}actually, they were once believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.17,0:23:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是狼人的后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be in the bloodline of werewolves,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.93,0:23:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但实际上 他们更类似恶魔 - 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but in fact, they are more similar to demons. - Deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.97,0:23:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干什么呢 探员 - 他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on, agent? - They, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.96,0:24:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们昵称的由来是因为他们出手很安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}they got their nickname from how quiet their attacks are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.72,0:24:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于他们很具隐蔽性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of their stealthiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.89,0:24:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经大隐于市几个世纪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've, uh, lived on the fringes for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.64,0:24:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也有几个在塞勒姆女巫时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although there were several that were hunted and killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.93,0:24:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,被抓到杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}during the Salem Witch…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.49,0:24:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 好吧 这上面说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Okay, according to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.64,0:24:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,低语只在日食期间进食\N{\fnArial\fs30}whispers only feed during the solar eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.64,0:24:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 迪恩 你在找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so, Dean, I-I don't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.05,0:24:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不是低语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you're hunting is a whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.17,0:24:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是别的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be another creature of some kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Fine, I'll say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.14,0:24:26.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨姆来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.70,0:24:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是你所谓的「狼血鬼」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it is your so-called "were-pire."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.75,0:24:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但老实说 我从没听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to be honest, I have never heard…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.65,0:24:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫这名字的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a creature with that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.50,0:24:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.33,0:24:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.40,0:24:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 迪恩 你没事吧 我听到了枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? Dean, are you all right? I hear gunshots.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.61,0:24:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.68,0:24:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.21,0:24:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚枪杀了警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it turns out I did shoot the deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.28,0:25:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 迪恩 出什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Dean, is… is everything…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.14,0:25:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官是个狼血鬼 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deputy was a were-pire. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.74,0:25:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,银弹起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver bullets worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.16,0:25:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 迪恩 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean, listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.97,0:25:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从传说看 时间不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}according to the lore, the timing is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.10,0:25:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,距下次北美日食还远着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next solar eclipse in north America is years away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.04,0:25:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不可能 - 等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It can't be a… - Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.27,0:25:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.01,0:25:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 那不可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, it couldn't be…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.02,0:25:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.02,0:25:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我没说 得砍头…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scratch that. You gotta cut off their…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.40,0:25:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 不是低语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's not a whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.82,0:25:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm starting to get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.03,0:25:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等我下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.29,0:26:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Th…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.02,0:26:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.55,0:26:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.11,0:27:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑一个 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smile, asshat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.15,0:27:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小卡 在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Cass, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.67,0:27:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.19,0:27:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么 银能拖慢它的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever it is, silver slows it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.08,0:27:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在给你发去一张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, I'm sending you a picture right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.38,0:27:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是它的獠牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}of its fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.11,0:27:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.49,0:27:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看传说中有没有符合的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if there's a match in the lore, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.82,0:27:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.08,0:27:30.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨姆 需要紧急救援 打给我 萨姆一通未接来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.61,0:27:30.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（呼叫萨姆）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.51,0:27:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我被袭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I got jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.94,0:27:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 暂时没事了应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - I think… for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.97,0:27:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该是一群怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure we're dealing with a pack here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.49,0:27:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赶到时 有两个正在袭击马克汉姆太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, two of these things were attacking Mrs. Markham when I arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.51,0:27:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打了一堆银弹 但也只是拖慢了他们的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I filled them with silver, but it only slowed them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.08,0:27:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢蛋警官也是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, deputy dumbass is one of them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.42,0:27:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在两截了 但还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh, he's in two pieces and still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.92,0:27:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪 - 马克汉姆太太被击昏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you at now? - Mrs. Markham was knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.99,0:27:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她抱到附近一间房子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I carried her to the house nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.74,0:27:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就把地址发给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I'll text you the address now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.09,0:27:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住 我就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, sit tight. I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.28,0:28:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们被袭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy's gettin' jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.53,0:28:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赶到时门就是敞开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Door was open when I got to the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.19,0:28:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搜完房子时\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I searched through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.93,0:28:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经把她打昏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd already beaten her unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.42,0:28:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许她知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she knew something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.47,0:28:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于她丈夫的遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}or something about what happened to her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.36,0:28:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 他们想干掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, they tried to take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.35,0:28:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而警官则折返去犯罪现场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the deputy went back to the scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.03,0:28:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想把现场布置好 却碰到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he went to fix it up. Found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.18,0:28:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 告诉我你有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass, tell me you got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.49,0:28:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且跟小妞进监狱无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}that doesn't involve chicks in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.61,0:28:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到你会说出这种话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you never thought you'd say that out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.57,0:28:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是尼塔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Nachzehrer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.89,0:28:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.55,0:28:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种食尸鬼加吸血鬼一类的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghoul and vampire-like creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.51,0:28:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是尸血鬼 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghoul-pire! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.96,0:28:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的族群吃尸体的腐肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some breeds feed on the flesh of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.72,0:28:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有的吃活人的血液和心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others feed on the blood and hearts of the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.90,0:29:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是小群体聚居的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They run in small packs,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.84,0:29:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但通常行事都非常低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they usually keep an extremely low profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那怎么才能弄死它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. So how do we kill 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.98,0:29:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.43,0:29:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,换句话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So in a manner of speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.58,0:29:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们只需要被人提醒它们已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they just need to be reminded that they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.82,0:29:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要一枚冥神的银币\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a charon's obol.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.62,0:29:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.70,0:29:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在古希腊 当一个人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, in ancient Greece, uh, when a person died,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.33,0:29:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的人认为 得放一枚银币 或者硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}some people believed you had to put an obol, or a-a coin,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.90,0:29:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在死者嘴里 这样死者就能以此来交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}in their mouth so they can use it as currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.33,0:29:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,被摆渡去冥河对岸 进入地下世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be taken across the river to the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.40,0:29:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你们要往尼塔特嘴里放个硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, you place a coin in a nachzehrer's mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.75,0:29:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把头割下来 这样就能杀死它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then sever their head, and that will kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.78,0:29:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 据说 如果杀掉它们的群头领\N{\fnArial\fs30}And according to the lore, if you kill the pack's alpha,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.76,0:29:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们转化的所有人都将恢复为人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone they've turned will revert back to human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.30,0:29:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 好吧 咱们上哪找银币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. All right, where do we find an obol?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.74,0:29:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据记录者的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, according to the men of letters' records,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.65,0:29:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要一枚铜板\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna need a copper coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.66,0:29:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以前用的是便士 所以你们得去找个来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used to use pennies, so you'll need one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.88,0:29:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 可那得是1982年以前的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but one minted pre-1982.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.68,0:29:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,1982年以前 便士含95%的铜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So before 1982, pennies were 95% copper.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.27,0:29:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来就改用镀铜锌币了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since then, they're only copper-plated zinc.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.11,0:29:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的书呆子属性简直突破天际\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your nerdiness knows no bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.08,0:29:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.33,0:29:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 谢了 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, thanks Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.31,0:29:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 你真立功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work. Way to come off the bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.18,0:29:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What bench?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.30,0:29:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续疗伤吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get back to getting better, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.00,0:30:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.55,0:30:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这年头上哪找便士去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, I mean, who carries pennies these days anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.25,0:30:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去去就回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.14,0:30:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.48,0:30:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克汉姆太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Markham?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.76,0:30:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克汉姆太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Markham.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.06,0:30:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我是迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'm dean winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.96,0:30:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我弟弟萨姆… - 我这是在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My … my brother Sam and… - Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.92,0:30:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被杀死你丈夫的那群人袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were attacked by the same people that killed your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.72,0:30:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.02,0:30:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他到底出了什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now do you know something about what happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.16,0:30:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这就是那些人袭击你的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's why these people attacked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.69,0:30:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们会带你去个安全的地方 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well, we're gonna take you someplace safe, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.32,0:30:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们会灭了这群狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we're gonna kill these sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.77,0:30:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could … uh, I could explain that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.47,0:30:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还是算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.37,0:30:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是袭击你的那种东西 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's like the thing that attacked you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.67,0:31:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它叫尸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's … it's a ghoul-pire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.53,0:31:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是 它不能再伤害你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, it can't hurt you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.15,0:31:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我觉得不能了…这么着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, I don't think it… Let's…You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.13,0:31:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们把它丢掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.22,0:31:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.84,0:31:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 看到没 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right. See? There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.33,0:31:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.31,0:31:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.17,0:31:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,人会为家人做任何事 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do anything for them, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.61,0:31:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.88,0:31:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也不能完全不计代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but not if it costs too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.87,0:31:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.66,0:31:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,人就是会为家人不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do everything for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.56,0:31:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此之外的一切都毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything else is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.21,0:31:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我做错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.15,0:31:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我毁了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I've ruined everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.27,0:31:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.60,0:32:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我的家人置于了险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put my family at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.69,0:32:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们袭击我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were right to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.80,0:32:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道要怎么弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know how to make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.83,0:32:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.73,0:32:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把创造者的尸体怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do with the maker's body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.55,0:32:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快告诉我 不然我灭了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna tell me or I will end you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.58,0:33:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没 也没那么难\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? That wasn't so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.13,0:33:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我知道该怎么对付你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I know what to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.35,0:33:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我能弥补这一切*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*I can make this right*
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.33,0:33:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我能弥补这一切*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*I can make this right*
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.89,0:33:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我能弥补这一切*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*I can make this right*
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.09,0:33:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我能弥补这一切*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*I can make this right*
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.80,0:33:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.80,0:33:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我都解决好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? I fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.13,0:33:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.55,0:33:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.52,0:33:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.60,0:33:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道你是尼塔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you're a nachzehrer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.11,0:33:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造者 对吗 群领头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The maker, right? The pack Alpha?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.44,0:34:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不像看上去那么傻嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe you're not as dumb as you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.68,0:34:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是喜欢保持低调的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you and yours like to keep a low profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.60,0:34:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜 莉莉这种菜鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, rookies like Lily here aren't up to snuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.86,0:34:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太会进食\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it comes to keeping their feeding quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.00,0:34:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说是你杀死了自己的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you killed your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.37,0:34:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不愿意加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.96,0:34:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愿意加入的人就是食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who don't join are food.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.90,0:34:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我搞砸了 我没埋好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I messed up, and I… I didn't bury him right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.88,0:34:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这其实是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fault, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.95,0:34:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没训练好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't properly trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.61,0:34:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但人人都该有第二次机会嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}but everyone deserves a mulligan, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.03,0:34:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的人想做的事 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all my people were trying to do, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.26,0:34:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是去杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.42,0:34:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.86,0:34:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一切可以得到的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need all the help I can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.89,0:34:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你转化了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have many have you turned?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.61,0:34:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,头一百年吗 三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the first hundred years? Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.40,0:34:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这三个月 16个\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the last month? 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.31,0:34:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,干吗 你要组个棒球队还是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you trying to field a baseball team?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了 我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I said, I need help,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.69,0:35:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能找到的所有力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}every strong hand I can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.53,0:35:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.66,0:35:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对抗黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fight the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.62,0:35:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要来了 冲我们所有人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's comin', for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.59,0:35:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何猎人和人类都没办法对抗它\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing hunters or any human can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.57,0:35:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么阻止它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how to stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.80,0:35:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得没什么能阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think anything can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.90,0:35:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想争取一些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just tryin' to buy some time,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.93,0:35:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我在努力转化尽可能多的男男女女\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm turning as many strong men and women as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.83,0:35:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟会成为军中不错的新添力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother will make a fine addition to the rank and file.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.25,0:35:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你昏迷期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you slept,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.86,0:35:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用你的手机给他发了条短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I send him a text message from your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.37,0:35:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在正往陷阱里钻呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's heading into a trap right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.73,0:35:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来也能做个优秀的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd make a good soldier, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.91,0:35:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你砍掉了我的头 这个我可忍不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you cut off my head, and I can't stand for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.18,0:35:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.58,0:36:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是那种物尽其用的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an every part of the buffalo kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.47,0:36:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的死不会白白浪费的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your death won't go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.74,0:36:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会成为你弟弟的第一餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be your brother's first meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.44,0:38:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Oh, baby, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.46,0:38:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 我都做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. What have I…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.48,0:38:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.39,0:38:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子们 他们转化了我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kids. They turned my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.59,0:38:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跟其他人在一起 拜托你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're with the others. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.41,0:38:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.51,0:38:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.40,0:39:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动啊 启动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.13,0:39:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给点力啊 宝贝 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby. Yeah! There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.18,0:39:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.72,0:40:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.70,0:40:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.60,0:40:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,「可能不是案子」 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably nothing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.27,0:40:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody all right back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.33,0:40:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他们都变回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah. They all changed back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.71,0:40:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个蠢蛋警官 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was Deputy dumbass, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.68,0:40:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 蠢蛋警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Deputy dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.95,0:40:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想组建军队来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he was trying to build an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.37,0:40:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.84,0:40:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了对抗黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fight the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.06,0:40:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 连怪物都吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, even the monsters are scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.40,0:40:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们怕去好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let 'em be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.58,0:40:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.27,0:40:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们这就了结了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna end this thing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.83,0:40:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天再开始 你不介意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind starting tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.40,0:40:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.36,0:40:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.54,0:40:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找小卡把你治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get Cass to fix you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.67,0:40:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他也把你治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if he fixes you up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.62,0:40:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊 老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.61,0:41:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.80,0:41:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.14,0:41:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经在家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.85,0:41:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.24,0:41:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's my girl.
